   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "PROBLEM / TRADE-OFF\nAll 32 heads see one K/V 'view' of the past:\nK/V diversity collapses -> quality drop vs MHA\n(GQA paper: MQA can lose quality and destabilise\ntraining). Motivation for GQA.",
   "originalText": "PROBLEM / TRADE-OFF\nAll 32 heads see one K/V 'view' of the past:\nK/V diversity collapses -> quality drop vs MHA\n(GQA paper: MQA can lose quality and destabilise\ntraining). Motivation for GQA.",
   "fontSize": 18,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
