   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "KEY INSIGHT\nOnly W_k and W_v shrink: 4096x4096 -> 4096x128.\nParams: 2 x (16.78M - 0.52M) = 32.5M saved/layer\n(~1.04B over 32 layers; often re-invested in the FFN).\nd_h = d_model / H_q = 4096 / 32 = 128 is unchanged.\nQ and W_o are untouched -> Q diversity intact.",
   "originalText": "KEY INSIGHT\nOnly W_k and W_v shrink: 4096x4096 -> 4096x128.\nParams: 2 x (16.78M - 0.52M) = 32.5M saved/layer\n(~1.04B over 32 layers; often re-invested in the FFN).\nd_h = d_model / H_q = 4096 / 32 = 128 is unchanged.\nQ and W_o are untouched -> Q diversity intact.",
   "fontSize": 18,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "e122",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
  {
   "id": "e124",
