   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "KEY INSIGHT\nPer head the math is untouched; only WHICH K/V a\nhead reads changes. In MQA step 5 and step 7 use one\nK and one V for all 32 heads (broadcast over head dim).",
   "originalText": "KEY INSIGHT\nPer head the math is untouched; only WHICH K/V a\nhead reads changes. In MQA step 5 and step 7 use one\nK and one V for all 32 heads (broadcast over head dim).",
