   "text": "4  Per-head math: O_i = softmax(Q_i K^T / sqrt(d_h)) V  - same K, V for every head i",
   "originalText": "4  Per-head math: O_i = softmax(Q_i K^T / sqrt(d_h)) V  - same K, V for every head i",
