   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1693074521,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "BATCHED DECODE TRICK (only possible because K is shared)\n  Q_all : (32, 128)      K^T : (128, T)\n  S = Q_all @ K^T  ->  (32, T)    ONE GEMM, K read once\n  MHA instead: 32 GEMVs (1,128)@(128,T), each reads its own K_i\n  -> rows of Q_all reuse every K byte 32 times = arithmetic intensity 32x higher",
   "originalText": "BATCHED DECODE TRICK (only possible because K is shared)\n  Q_all : (32, 128)      K^T : (128, T)\n  S = Q_all @ K^T  ->  (32, T)    ONE GEMM, K read once\n  MHA instead: 32 GEMVs (1,128)@(128,T), each reads its own K_i\n  -> rows of Q_all reuse every K byte 32 times = arithmetic intensity 32x higher",
   "fontSize": 17,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "e170",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
