   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "PROBLEM / TRADE-OFF\nMQA fixes only H_kv. M_KV is still linear in L, B and T:\nB = 26 sequences x 100K tokens still fills an A100; the lever for T is\nsliding windows, for S is FP8 KV, for L is CLA/YOCO.",
   "originalText": "PROBLEM / TRADE-OFF\nMQA fixes only H_kv. M_KV is still linear in L, B and T:\nB = 26 sequences x 100K tokens still fills an A100; the lever for T is\nsliding windows, for S is FP8 KV, for L is CLA/YOCO.",
   "fontSize": 18,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "e334",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
  {
