  {
   "id": "e339",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 10,
   "y": 3713.0,
   "width": 687.4,
   "height": 233.75,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 1758743964,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 2031522882,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "one layer, one decode token, S = 2 bytes (FP16/BF16)\n\nFLOPs  : QK^T  = 2 . d_h . T per head\n         P V   = 2 . d_h . T per head\n         total = 4 . H_q . d_h . T\nBytes  : K and V read = 2 . H_kv . d_h . T . S = 4 . H_kv . d_h . T\n         (Q, output and new k,v are negligible vs T)\n\nAI = 4 H_q d_h T / (4 H_kv d_h T) = H_q / H_kv   FLOP/byte\n\nMHA  32/32 = 1      GQA-8 32/8 = 4      MQA 32/1 = 32",
   "originalText": "one layer, one decode token, S = 2 bytes (FP16/BF16)\n\nFLOPs  : QK^T  = 2 . d_h . T per head\n         P V   = 2 . d_h . T per head\n         total = 4 . H_q . d_h . T\nBytes  : K and V read = 2 . H_kv . d_h . T . S = 4 . H_kv . d_h . T\n         (Q, output and new k,v are negligible vs T)\n\nAI = 4 H_q d_h T / (4 H_kv d_h T) = H_q / H_kv   FLOP/byte\n\nMHA  32/32 = 1      GQA-8 32/8 = 4      MQA 32/1 = 32",
   "fontSize": 17,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "e338",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
  {
   "id": "e340",
