   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "KEY INSIGHT\nEven MQA (AI = 32) sits ~6x LEFT of the A100 ridge (200):\ndecode attention stays MEMORY-BOUND. MQA buys 32x fewer\nbytes -> ~32x faster KV streaming, it does not make decode compute-bound.\n(Weight GEMVs at small batch have AI ~ B: also memory-bound.)",
   "originalText": "KEY INSIGHT\nEven MQA (AI = 32) sits ~6x LEFT of the A100 ridge (200):\ndecode attention stays MEMORY-BOUND. MQA buys 32x fewer\nbytes -> ~32x faster KV streaming, it does not make decode compute-bound.\n(Weight GEMVs at small batch have AI ~ B: also memory-bound.)",
   "fontSize": 18,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "e354",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
