   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "KEY INSIGHT\nHeads can still ATTEND differently (q_i differ),\nbut they all RETRIEVE from the same value vectors.\nHeads differ only by mixing weights; W_o must\nrecombine near-identical value spaces.\nThe model loses per-head K/V specialisation\n(syntax / entity / position heads share one view).",
   "originalText": "KEY INSIGHT\nHeads can still ATTEND differently (q_i differ),\nbut they all RETRIEVE from the same value vectors.\nHeads differ only by mixing weights; W_o must\nrecombine near-identical value spaces.\nThe model loses per-head K/V specialisation\n(syntax / entity / position heads share one view).",
   "fontSize": 18,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "e371",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
