  {
   "id": "e389",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 10,
   "y": 4817.0,
   "width": 1462.0,
   "height": 112.5,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 844145915,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 2083730008,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "1. MQA = H_kv 1: every Q head attends over the single shared K and V.   Q diversity stays, K/V diversity collapses.\n2. Shapes: W_k, W_v 4096x128; K, V cache (B,1,T,128); scores (B,32,1,T); output (B,1,4096).\n3. KV memory and KV bytes read per token fall by H_q/H_kv = 32x (toy MHA 256 KiB/token -> MQA 8 KiB/token; 26.2 GB -> 0.82 GB at 100K).\n4. Decode AI = H_q/H_kv = 32 FLOP/B, still ~6x below the A100 ridge (~200): memory-bound, but 32x less to move.\n5. Cost: quality drop / instability, and one K/V head cannot shard across tensor-parallel GPUs. GQA picks the middle point.",
   "originalText": "1. MQA = H_kv 1: every Q head attends over the single shared K and V.   Q diversity stays, K/V diversity collapses.\n2. Shapes: W_k, W_v 4096x128; K, V cache (B,1,T,128); scores (B,32,1,T); output (B,1,4096).\n3. KV memory and KV bytes read per token fall by H_q/H_kv = 32x (toy MHA 256 KiB/token -> MQA 8 KiB/token; 26.2 GB -> 0.82 GB at 100K).\n4. Decode AI = H_q/H_kv = 32 FLOP/B, still ~6x below the A100 ridge (~200): memory-bound, but 32x less to move.\n5. Cost: quality drop / instability, and one K/V head cannot shard across tensor-parallel GPUs. GQA picks the middle point.",
   "fontSize": 18,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "e388",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
