   "locked": false,
   "text": "Sources: Shazeer 2019, 'Fast Transformer Decoding: One Write-Head is All You Need' (arXiv 1911.02150);  Ainslie et al. 2023, GQA (arXiv 2305.13245);  numbers from docs/chatgpt.md",
   "originalText": "Sources: Shazeer 2019, 'Fast Transformer Decoding: One Write-Head is All You Need' (arXiv 1911.02150);  Ainslie et al. 2023, GQA (arXiv 2305.13245);  numbers from docs/chatgpt.md",
